+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#41139"
+msgid "For \"Custom\": the gamma of your display in SDR, from 1.8 to 2.8: 2.4 for a reference display in a dark room (BT.1886), 2.2 for most TVs and monitors in a lit room. Set the one your display has: a lower value than your display's makes the mid-tones darker, a higher one lighter. 2.4 with white 203 is Reference, the same picture. Applies from the next video."
+msgstr ""
+
 #. Hades: added to the label of "Video scaling method" (video settings): the Dolby Vision output is scaled by Hades, not by this
 #: system/settings/settings.xml
